00:12:55.691 --> 00:12:56.620
&gt;&gt; I see.

00:12:56.621 --> 00:12:58.570
&gt;&gt; So, final assessment
could be you actually came

00:12:58.571 --> 00:12:59.950
to tell what's a missing value.

00:12:59.951 --> 00:13:00.310
&gt;&gt; Exactly.

00:13:00.311 --> 00:13:01.000
&gt;&gt; What's that bond express.

00:13:01.001 --> 00:13:02.680
&gt;&gt; Yeah, there's
nothing no distinction.

00:13:02.681 --> 00:13:03.160
&gt;&gt; Exactly. Yeah.

00:13:03.161 --> 00:13:03.280
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:13:03.281 --> 00:13:05.450
&gt;&gt; The algorithm doesn't
