00:13:29.691 --> 00:13:30.530
&gt;&gt; Yes. Yes.

00:13:30.531 --> 00:13:31.190
&gt;&gt; So, yeah.

00:13:31.191 --> 00:13:33.080
&gt;&gt; If you have a transcript
that dominates.

00:13:33.081 --> 00:13:33.920
&gt;&gt; You'll see it.

00:13:33.921 --> 00:13:34.340
&gt;&gt; You'll see it.

00:13:34.341 --> 00:13:35.950
&gt;&gt; New cancer cells
